This is a step-by-step instruction to use LMP_Gau, the integration between Gaussian and LAMMPS

1. In the bash script, edit the correct location of the LAMMPS folder
2. Paste the Python scripts and executables from Fortran scripts in the same folder as the bash script.
3. Run the Gaussian input file. The Gaussian input file should contain the following keywords: nosym external='./gau_lmp.sh'. Many examples of Gaussian input files can be found in the "SI_files" folder.